<Layout title="Privacy — GHL Bangladesh"
  ><section class="page-hero wrap narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">GHL BANGLADESH</span><h1>Your privacy.</h1>
  </section><section class="wrap narrow prose" style="padding-bottom:80px">
    <p>This notice describes the community website at ghlbangladesh.com.</p><h2>
      Browsing this website
    </h2><p>
      This website does not provide accounts, collect membership applications,
      or ask you to submit personal information through a form. Our hosting and
      network providers may process technical request information, such as IP
      addresses and browser details, to deliver and protect the website.
    </p><h2>External websites</h2><p>
      Links to Facebook, Playbook, and HighLevel take you to external services.
      Information you share on those services is subject to their own privacy
      policies and settings.
    </p><h2>Event photography</h2><p>
      We feature selected photographs from our community event collection. If
      you appear in a photograph and would like to discuss its use or request
      removal, please <a href="/contact">contact the organizer</a>.
    </p><h2>Contact</h2><p>
      For questions about this website or your privacy, use the organizer
      contact link on our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section></Layout
